Z||000001||Old Lar||11-06-2001||10:11 PM||||IN 1984 there was an Econo coupe, a Sport coupe, and the Pace car.  The Sport coupe was one of 62,070 built in 1984 out of a total production run of 136,840 Fieros built in 1984.  The car has a 4 cylinder (2.5L) with a four speed transmission.||||reg||1
